{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"sf6b149aebda264a5","language":"zh-CN","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-2dbea687a8b9f24fc65b","text":"是没见过的勇士呢…长相倒是蛮可爱的，我喜欢嗡…","speaker":"黄金蝶"},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-0dadfedd59a542af45ff","text":"宝宝你是一只会说话的蝴蝶…","speaker":""},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-32674e6b1a2f321807b3","text":"嗡是什么意思？","speaker":""},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-7a81a85be3d1c2d4f6d5","text":"我一眼就看出你不是人！","speaker":""},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-4db5b183a02095140d9e","text":"欸~你们竟然能识破我的伪装，难道你们也是我家太太的祭司？好久没见到它了嗡…","speaker":"黄金蝶"},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-d7f46c3db19f6472d19f","text":"可惜，如果你们也是若虫的话，我们就能在一起愉快玩耍了嗡。","speaker":"黄金蝶"}]}
